# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Function sizes {#function-sizes}"
msgstr "Mga laki ng function {#function-sizes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The function runs with a compute size, `\"S\"`, `\"M\"`, or `\"L\"`, which you set with the `function_size` argument of `run`. The size that your problem needs follows the limits of the plans:\n"
msgstr "Tumatakbo ang function sa isang compute size, `\"S\"`, `\"M\"`, o `\"L\"`, na itinatakda mo gamit ang argumentong `function_size` ng `run`. Ang laking kailangan ng problema mo ay sumusunod sa mga limitasyon ng mga plan:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The mode (the session mode requires the size `\"L\"`)\n"
msgstr "Ang mode (ang session mode ay nangangailangan ng laking `\"L\"`)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The total number of iterations, which is the sum of the `max_iter` of all the stages of the `optimizers` chain\n"
msgstr "Ang kabuuang bilang ng iteration, na siyang kabuuan ng `max_iter` ng lahat ng stage ng `optimizers` chain\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum number of shots per job, which is the largest `shot` of the stages (more than 100,000 shots per job is not supported)\n"
msgstr "Ang maximum na bilang ng shot bawat job, na siyang pinakamalaking `shot` sa mga stage (hindi sinusuportahan ang higit sa 100,000 shot bawat job)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '* '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The maximum number of qubits, which is the number of qubits of the largest function\n"
msgstr "Ang maximum na bilang ng qubit, na siyang bilang ng qubit ng pinakamalaking function\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The size is the smallest one for which all these values stay within its limits. The onboarding and the support depend on your plan and are not part of the calculation. A problem above the limits of the size `\"M\"` is sized `\"L\"`.\n"
msgstr "Ang laki ay ang pinakamaliit kung saan nananatili sa mga limitasyon nito ang lahat ng value na ito. Ang onboarding at ang suporta ay nakadepende sa plan mo at hindi bahagi ng kalkulasyon. Ang problemang lampas sa mga limitasyon ng laking `\"M\"` ay may laking `\"L\"`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If the size you pass is smaller than the size that the problem needs, the job fails with the error code 4600. If it is larger, the job runs and reports an event with the error code 4601 to tell you that a smaller size can be used.\n"
msgstr "Kung mas maliit ang laking ipinasa mo kaysa sa laking kailangan ng problema, pumapalya ang job na may error code 4600. Kung mas malaki, tumatakbo ang job at nag-uulat ng event na may error code 4601 para sabihing puwedeng gumamit ng mas maliit na laki.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The following function calculates the size of a problem from the same arguments as `run`, without submitting anything. When `optimizers` or `nb_qubits` are omitted, the default values of the use case are used, as in `run`.\n"
msgstr "Kinukuwenta ng sumusunod na function ang laki ng isang problema mula sa parehong mga argumento ng `run`, nang hindi nagsusumite ng anuman. Kapag hindi ibinigay ang `optimizers` o `nb_qubits`, ginagamit ang mga default na value ng use case, tulad ng sa `run`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For example, a basket of three assets with a chain of three stages needs a total of 40 iterations and up to 20,000 shots, so it fits size `\"M\"`:\n"
msgstr "Halimbawa, ang basket ng tatlong asset na may chain na tatlong stage ay nangangailangan ng kabuuang 40 iteration at hanggang 20,000 shot, kaya akma ito sa laking `\"M\"`:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then pass the size to `run`:\n"
msgstr "Pagkatapos ay ipasa ang laki sa `run`:\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
